---
const tiles = 6;
---

<section class="w-full py-section">
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-page flex-col gap-32 px-gutter lg:px-[8.875rem]">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-8 lg:flex-row">
      <h2 class="font-display text-h3 tracking-tight whitespace-nowrap">Visual Archive</h2>

      <div class="prose-justified flex max-w-[38.0625rem] flex-col font-body text-body tracking-tight">
        <p>An accumulation of recorded moments, translated into form.</p>
        <p>
          Across analogue and computational processes, data is collected, rearranged and
          transformed, revealing the variations through which each visual language emerges.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <ul class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-16 gap-y-24 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-x-56 lg:gap-y-36">
      {Array.from({ length: tiles }, () => <li class="aspect-square bg-surface" />)}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
